#2203
A Small Shrine~
   You stand at what could be considered the entrance to a small shrine
which is enclosed within this room. Flames dance around in a rhythmic fashion,
held in place by a number of torches set into the walls. Sand covers the
floor, perhaps a result of erosion of the sandstone blocks from which this
chamber has been made.
   A narrow set of stairs leads down into another lit chamber below while far
above your head you can just make out a large crack in one of the sandstone
walls.
