hieroglyphics~
0~
This level of the ziggurat was apparently used as a mass crypt, a resting
place for both criminals and heroes of whatever race used to inhabit these
lands. Criminals were put to death in a rather gruesome fashion while those
of valor and courage were afforded an almost royal burial. The vessels you
see before you were used as storage containers for their organs, perhaps part
of some religious belief.
~
